# Normalization: B0 -> D*- l+ nu (l = e, mu; 50/50) with the same D* chain as the signal.
# Form factor: ISGW2 (v1; upgrade to BGL/CLN later).

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.000  B0sig anti-B0sig B0 anti-B0   VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay B0sig
0.500  D*-sig e+  nu_e               ISGW2;
0.500  D*-sig mu+ nu_mu              ISGW2;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-B0sig

Decay D*-sig
1.000  anti-D0sig pi-                VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay D*+sig

Decay anti-D0sig
1.000  K+ pi-                        PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay D0sig

End
